'''Hallowgun''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2020 Halloween box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2020|2020 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended. 

== Appearance ==
Hallowgun is a revolver with three spikes intertwining the barrel. The overall colors of the gun is grey, yellow, orange and silver, with the ombre yellow to orange barrel and the cylinder being silver. The bottom of the handle and the trigger is covered in silver lining.

==Trivia==
* It partners with the [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] knife [[Hallowscythe]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Hallow Set|Hallow Set]].
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].
*This was the third [[Godly Weapons|godly]] [[Guns|gun]] in a row in a holiday box.

